      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2997339838,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I imagine that that it hasn't popped up sooner because the current recommendation is for an out-of-tree build (or, e.g., a \"build\" subdirectory). Not that it makes this a bad thing, to be sure, just probably many people are doing that instead.",
